{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f7948e3d33f21bb4412907891ddca98d493d64861f98ad93594c1c7dbcd02018", "ja": "（美希が新しい衣装を試着中だ。アイドルらしさは\nもちろん、街中でも着られるように意識してみた……）", "zh": "（美希正在试穿新服装。不仅考虑到了偶像风格，也有意识地设计成在街上也能穿……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "158c69bbad45a0fe2be69aca6d927825fc3b28d4a79f97c7cbf3a3a96bb7118d", "ja": "この衣装、ちょっと不思議だね。\nなんだか普通にお出かけできそうなの！", "zh": "这套服装，有点不可思议呢。\n感觉穿着它就能很自然地出门逛街了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
