{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1003_p", "source_sha256": "086d3b28ffe8e1daeb6b13d6275ee9a2762f558b0de09dc59796dbb0109c2ec8", "ja": "美希が喜んでくれてよかったよ。楽曲に合うように\nデートの時にも着られるように考えてみたんだ。", "zh": "美希能开心就好。为了配合歌曲，我还考虑过让它也能在约会时穿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "225d7607e985292cb066bbca96e44e1b1ebdd9f87ffde1577109063433787213", "ja": "そうなんだ。……あっ！\nそういうことなら、今からお散歩デートしてみる？", "zh": "这样啊。……啊！\n既然这样，要不要现在就来一场散步约会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "5557a03e7f9bd05dbd66936efbe51209369e9109fab3d5d775626a6c2b7582f7", "ja": "劇場の周りなら、すぐ戻ってこられるでしょ？\nあんまりジロジロ見られなかったら、駅の方まで……。", "zh": "如果只是在剧场附近，应该很快就能回来吧？\n要是没被人一直盯着看的话，去车站那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c5ba5142511d75fa601221a892dec1cf62996506200991cab92ea38ae7b93f4b", "ja": "ま、待った！　お散歩は楽しそうだけど……\nあくまでも、衣装のイメージってだけなんだ。", "zh": "等、等等！散步听起来是不错，但是……\n终究也只是服装带来的印象而已啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3b3d01d5da5bdc77bef26bc41a0563220d39d432d0511a6da71f04dda858ac6d", "ja": "だから、お散歩デートはまた今度な。", "zh": "所以，散步约会下次再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "ea3ebc0f94a66e7c2c384f3c2e9a4ac0ad0ec24cdbfd5d9e1f58acf4116993d4", "ja": "……わかったの。せっかくだし、\n今はミキが、衣装を独り占めしーちゃお☆", "zh": "……好吧。难得有这个机会，\n现在就由美希来独占这件服装吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4574abf6c9826668705c9e71720efc5d85c4b5908bad86e4480f01133720c5c", "ja": "ハニーがミキのこと、いっぱい考えながら\n用意してくれた衣装だから、ね♪", "zh": "因为这是亲爱的想着美希的事，为美希准备的服装嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7bd0bf83c2e4bb1a6cc0e3c07f1ab722778c1673f91e094de77f4fd582646cca", "ja": "ま、まぁ間違いではないんだけど……。\nその言い方は誤解されそうだな……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……也不能说错……只是那种说法容易让人产生误会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "67bd4cd145207e672c9c0bffa2de0668480d99712ab964c1bec813016ae182f2", "ja": "そうかな？　でも、いっぱいハニーのことを考えた\nプレゼントもらえたら嬉しいでしょ？", "zh": "是这样吗？不过，我可是认真想了很多关于亲爱的事情。收到礼物的话，会很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
