{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0504_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c0ae69b2d0322454a1b897f06db8667fa5a9e97ccb3758af2968496287b86a6f", "ja": "確かに。まだ誰にも見せてないっていう特別感は、\n今だけしか味わえないもんな。", "zh": "确实。\"还没给任何人看过\"这种特别的感觉，\n也只有现在才能体会到啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
